#: ../../source/users/conductor/what_is.rst:7
msgid "What is a conductor?"
msgstr "什么是导体？"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/what_is.rst:9
msgid ""
"A `conductor`_ or conduit represents the means of transmission of "
"information, electrical power, flow power (pressure or flow volume) between "
"source and target."
msgstr "`导体 <conductor_>`_ 或导管表示源与目标之间传递信息、电能、流体动力（压力或流量）的媒介。"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/what_is.rst:15
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech conductor"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 导体"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/what_is.rst:17
msgid ""
"In physical systems, T-crosses are used at fluid lines and terminal blocks "
"are used to feed different electrical devices from the same source. "
"QElectroTech also allows multiple connections between source and target."
msgstr "在物理系统中，T 形接头用于流体管路，端子排用于从同一来源为不同电气设备供电。QElectroTech 也允许源与目标之间存在多个连接。"
